**Application to current paper**: Missing comparisons include: (1) recent neural architecture search methods for compiler optimization, (2) hybrid static-dynamic approaches beyond simple feature concatenation, (3) other self-supervised pre-training strategies for code (e.g., CodeBERT, GraphCodeBERT when applied to compiler IR), (4) reinforcement learning-based optimization sequence predictors.

