**Application to current paper**: Missing ablations include: (1) the impact of varying the number of probes P, (2) the effect of different probe selection strategies (e.g., random vs. cluster-based), (3) sensitivity to the number of sub-vectors M in Product Quantization, (4) the impact of codebook size k*, (5) comparison of different logarithmic vs. other scale-invariant transformations.

