### 4. Limited Baseline Comparisons and Metrics

While the paper compares against several baselines (GIES, IGSP, UT-IGSP, JCI-GSP, FCI-interven, CDIS), the number of methods specifically designed for similar settings (latent confounders + selection bias) appears limited.

**Quote from relevant review (Nx4PMtJ1ER, Human Reviewer 2):**
