> "No evaluation of correctly sampling the generative model: The paper evaluates small molecule generation by embedding existing molecules and perturbing their latents instead of sampling the transformer autoregressively."

**Applied to current paper:** MolMiner should include comparisons with more recent fragment-based and conditional generation methods (e.g., MoLeR with proper training, MARS without oracle access, or other multi-property conditional models) to substantiate claims of superior performance.

