**Applied to current paper:** Testing on only ZINC limits understanding of how well the method generalizes to other molecular distributions (e.g., larger druglike molecules, natural products, or specific therapeutic areas). The fragment vocabulary learned from ZINC may not transfer well to molecules with different structural motifs.

