- Quote from `ijwYWoChN9` review on lack of causal rationale
- Quote from `cRR0oDFEBC` review on incomplete baseline comparisons
- Quote from `VpWki1v2P8` review on hyperparameter exploration
- Quote from `A6Y7AqlzLW` review on single-family evaluation and computational costs
