- Point 2 pattern from DiRJUdmZoK.md (VIM benchmark): noting confounded evaluations when motivation doesn't match evaluation setup
- Point 3 quoted from VB8xHF1Rdl.md (information theory in LLMs): "The formulation...are sketchy, missing sufficient justifications"
