## Summary of Analysis

I found several reviews with common weakness patterns that are relevant to your paper on multimodal attribution with adaptive information bottleneck. The most relevant patterns come from papers on:

1. **Methods with adaptive/dynamic mechanisms** (lXRDQsiP2v - Token Statistics Transformer on task-specific hyperparameter tuning)
