4. **Lack of detailed per-token analysis supporting the core premise**: While the paper argues for token-specific language priors rather than uniform priors (differentiating from VCD, VDD, M3ID), it provides limited visualization or quantitative analysis showing how the method differentially modulates different token types. A direct analysis of which tokens receive stronger suppression would strengthen the claim.

