5. **Lack of empirical validation of theoretical assumptions and failure case analysis**: The paper assumes source condition (Assumption 2) and capacity condition (Assumption 3) hold, but provides no empirical analysis of when these assumptions are satisfied in practice or how performance degrades when violated. The paper also lacks discussion of failure modes where aggregation might not help—for instance, when the sequence of models is severely suboptimal or when the combined sample is very small.

