## Weaknesses

**1. Very limited quantitative evaluation and results presentation**

The paper provides only one visual example of an adversarial attack (Figure 2, showing a digit 7 misclassified as 2) without comprehensive robustness metrics or detailed accuracy tables. Claims such as "FGSM is not able to fool the trained network" lack supporting quantitative evidence. 

