- E6rpTruK4v.md (CodeUnlearn review): Issues on evaluation completeness, missing ablation studies, and clarity on reproducibility
- V7PYbRzD0h.md (Chain-of-Jailbreak review): Questions on robustness of decomposition methods and reliability of automated approaches
- CkgKSqZbuC.md (R²-Guard review): Discussion of manually curated rules, detection module design clarity, and generalization to unseen scenarios
