The iterative co-training scheme requires alternating between consensus clustering (spectral decomposition) and MLP training, which could be computationally expensive for large-scale datasets. The paper does not discuss theoretical time/space complexity or compare computational efficiency with baselines. One reviewer observed: "The space complexity of Algorithm 2 is not described enough." (KijslFbfOL.md)
</final_review>
